            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.17.11+JOS.17.12+JOS.17.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Josh 17.11–13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The tribe of Manasseh did not drive out the people living in the cities of Beth Shan, Taanach, Dor, Ibleam, Megiddo, and the nearby towns; the Canaanites continued to live there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the Israelites became stronger, they forced the Canaanites to work for them, but still they did not drive them all out.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
